                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngaaya makani aakasinsimwa aa-Moabu. Ari mbuusaalidwe masiku, Moabu wanyonyooka! Kiri mbuusaalidwe masiku, Moabu wanyonyoo­ ka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waya kukulila kuzipaililo zyakuzilundu ku-Bayiti aku-Diboni, Ba-Moabu balalilila Nebo a-Medeba. Amitwe yoonse aboneka cinkulu, azyalo zilezu zyoonse zilinyooledwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumigwagwa yabo balisamide zisani zyamasaka, Atala anduli zyabo amumasambalilo aabo boonse balalila amisozi ilambulumuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "My 32:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awalo Hesiboni ulalila, a-Eleale. Ijwi lyayo lilamvwigwa kule akusikila ku-Jahaza. Nkaambo kako basilumamba baMoabu balalilisya, Myoyo yabo ilakankama muzyamba zyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.48.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 48:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moyo wangu ulalila Moabu. Basilutwe bakwe bacijila ku-Zoari, ku-Egilati watatu, Balaya butanta kuya ku-Luhiti, balaya bulila, nkaambo munzila ya-Horonaimu balalizya cililo calunyonyooko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo maanzi aaNimirimi ayooyuminina. Mani apusama, mweemvwe wanyana, taakwe mafulo aasia-sia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako buvubi mbubajisi ambono nzibabikide, zyoonse ziyootolwa kukalonga kamizimbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo cililo casika koonse koonse kumigaano yoonse ya-Moabu. Kuuula kwabo kwamvwigwa akuEglaimu, kuuula kwabo kwamvwigwa ku-Beerelimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo meenda aa-Dimoni alizwide bulowa, nkaambo njooletela Dimoni aamwi mapenzi. Ba-Moabu balobokede abaabo basyeede munyika, njoobausizya balavu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
